[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13620.469, "timestamp": "03:47:00", "text": "这部作品里会有神吗？不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13623.429, "timestamp": "03:47:03", "text": "会有鸡蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13627.189, "timestamp": "03:47:07", "text": "鸡蛋？是的。你要吃饭了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13629.269, "timestamp": "03:47:09", "text": "去吃饭 你看到了 你看到了 你看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13633.189, "timestamp": "03:47:13", "text": "这个团体？你看到这酸性粪便了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13635.83, "timestamp": "03:47:15", "text": "我们将用这些来清理它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13637.429, "timestamp": "03:47:17", "text": "瓶子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13641.03, "timestamp": "03:47:21", "text": "所以，我现在正在做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13644.389, "timestamp": "03:47:24", "text": "哦，然后我们会找到鸡蛋，然后我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13646.03, "timestamp": "03:47:26", "text": "会洗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13649.349, "timestamp": "03:47:29", "text": "然后我们会把他们献祭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13651.59, "timestamp": "03:47:31", "text": "祭坛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13654.87, "timestamp": "03:47:34", "text": "哦，别把医疗包放在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13658.63, "timestamp": "03:47:38", "text": "照常。把东西拿在这里。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13660.87, "timestamp": "03:47:40", "text": "把医疗包放在中间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13663.67, "timestamp": "03:47:43", "text": "我会净化它并发送。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13665.83, "timestamp": "03:47:45", "text": "还有岩石水体之类的东西。你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13667.349, "timestamp": "03:47:47", "text": "什么？在此之前，我们先……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13669.91, "timestamp": "03:47:49", "text": "你知道，就是触发Zara的那个。我们去找Zara吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13671.95, "timestamp": "03:47:51", "text": "来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13674.87, "timestamp": "03:47:54", "text": "很高兴你现在就想做这件事。神话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13676.63, "timestamp": "03:47:56", "text": "神话。你想现在就做吗？我们不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13678.07, "timestamp": "03:47:58", "text": "我们不会攻击她。我们不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13679.67, "timestamp": "03:47:59", "text": "我们会牺牲所有鸡蛋，但我们需要"}]